WEBVTT

00:15:59.579 --> 00:16:01.412
that it could ever be different.

00:16:02.496 --> 00:16:05.996
But this is no way to run
the shining city on a hill

00:16:06.037 --> 00:16:07.996
that is America.

00:16:08.037 --> 00:16:09.954
We can choose different.

00:16:09.996 --> 00:16:14.121
Our Constitution gives us that power

00:16:14.162 --> 00:16:17.162
and, I believe, the responsibility

00:16:17.204 --> 00:16:21.412
to remake our politics when we need to --

00:16:21.454 --> 00:16:23.287
and we need to.

00:16:23.329 --> 00:16:27.204
With the greatest urgency
and without fatigue,

00:16:27.246 --> 00:16:31.412
we must aggressively reclaim
the enormous promise